 " (InfraGeometry)",
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "of a message or echo relation: \"DomainDefect\", \"FunctionDefect\", \
\"InjectivityDefect\", \"OrderDefect\", how far the relation is from a \
monotone bijection on the window left by the option \"Boundary\", and \
\"KFactor\", the Bondi factor of two observers from their tick-span ratios, \
exact on the lattice for the chains ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], "+", "1"}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     StyleBox["m", "TI"]}], ",", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"p", "m"}], "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "499e92ba-9fac-4130-90ed-7d91a0da3ee6"],
 " of velocity ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "/", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"2", 
    StyleBox["p", "TI"], "+", "1"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5b1b9b12-04a7-445f-beb5-872d77f882be"]
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"05e55aa3-662e-4ef4-bb33-5174a29723e3"]
